  "_comment_observability": "Every agent writes traces and metrics. Those two roles are not derived from scopes -- a scope says what data an agent may touch, and telemetry is not data it touches. Granted to every agent identity instead, because a worker that cannot export a span reports tracing_enabled and drops every trace: the failure is invisible at the agent and shows up as an empty Cloud Trace."
